# Google C++ style, stock. The value of a published style is that this
# file stays empty of local opinion: tooling, editors, and new
# contributors all agree by default. Add an override only when stock
# Google is genuinely broken for this codebase, with a comment saying
# why.
#
# The whole-tree reformat onto this style is a single commit listed in
# .git-blame-ignore-revs, so blame skips it. Vendored and generated
# sources are never formatted: see .clang-format-ignore.
BasedOnStyle: Google
